m(m - 1) / 2
	= (12 - 2n) * (11 - 2n) / 2
	= (6 - n) * (11 - 2n)
	= 66 - 12n - 11n + 2n^2
	= 2n^2 - 23n + 66

Balanced:
2n^2 + 4 * n(n-1) / 2 + 12 * m(m-1) / 2
